cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "RDMA: Rare Disease Mining Agents"
abstract: >-
  An agent-driven pipeline for mining rare diseases and phenotypes from
  electronic health records, pairing LLM extraction with ontology-grounded
  verification and matching against Orphanet and the Human Phenotype Ontology.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jhnwu3/RDMA"
